cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Ebook Voice Player"
abstract: >-
  Ebook Voice Player is a Windows text-to-speech (TTS) ebook reader that opens
  TXT, DOCX, PDF, EPUB and HTML books, reads them aloud with 322 neural voices
  across 75 languages, highlights the paragraph being spoken, and exports
  narration to MP3. This repository hosts the product website and the bilingual
  guide library.
